      "source": "```swift\nfunc addOne<T: Strideable>(to x: T) -> T\n    where T.Stride: ExpressibleByIntegerLiteral\n{\n    return x.advanced(by: 1)\n}\n\nlet x = addOne(to: 5)\n// x == 6\nlet y = addOne(to: 3.5)\n// y = 4.5\n```",
